      <p>We do not sell personal information to third parties for their own advertising or marketing purposes as typically defined. However, under the CCPA's broad definition of "sale," sharing certain data with advertising or analytics partners may qualify. Please see our <a href="/ccpa/">Do Not Sell or Share My Personal Information</a> page to exercise your opt-out rights.</p>
