      <h2>How to Submit a Request</h2>
      <p class="legal-short">In Short: You may submit privacy requests by email or via our designated opt-out page.</p>
      <p>To exercise your rights described above, please contact us by:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a>, subject line: "California Privacy Request"</li>
        <li><strong>Opt-Out Page:</strong> Visit <a href="/ccpa/">911cancerlawsuit.com/ccpa</a> to submit a Do Not Sell or Share request.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We will acknowledge your request within 10 business days and respond within 45 calendar days. If we require more time (up to an additional 45 days), we will inform you of the reason and extension period in writing. We may need to verify your identity before processing your request.</p>
      <p>You may designate an authorized agent to submit a request on your behalf. We may deny a request if we cannot verify the identity of the requestor or the agent's authorization.</p>
